{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07695","headline":"襄阳公宅饮 · 孟浩然","name":"襄阳公宅饮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"窈窕夕阳佳，䒠茸春色好。\n欲觅淹留处，无过狭斜道。\n绮席卷龙须，香杯浮码碯。\n北林积修树，南池生别岛。\n手拨金翠花，心迷玉红草。\n谈笑光六义，发论明三倒。\n座非陈子惊，门还魏公扫。\n荣辱应无间，欢娱当共保。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}